        "note": "郡縣田祿於芒種交割，本段前後任對領祿人的影響各有版本異文。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 44,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
