        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "qkt_yf2_rsg",
        "source_quote": "初發京師，親故或以器物贈別，得便緘錄，後歸，悉以還之。",
        "reading": "出京受贈器物，緘記，後還故人。",
        "note": "出京受贈器物，緘記，後還故人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 81,
        "end_codepoint": 108,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:received_sentence3-108",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "qkt_yf2_rsg",
        "source_quote": "在中書省直，夜往鄰省，誤著履出閤，依事自列門下，門下以闇夜人不知，不受列，長之固遣送之，曰：「一生不侮闇室。」",
        "reading": "夜誤著履出閤，自列於門下；門下不受而長之堅持送案。",
        "note": "夜誤著履出閤，自列於門下；門下不受而長之堅持送案。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 108,
        "end_codepoint": 163,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:received_sentence3-163",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "qkt_yf2_rsg",
