        "reading": "歷官有政聲，宋人以善治稱之。",
        "note": "歷官有政聲，宋人以善治稱之。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 163,
        "end_codepoint": 191,
        "human_reviewed": false
